WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:12.879
Indoor kitchen: Person in black apron kneads dough in bowl; pours water, mixes into shaggy mass.

2
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.971
Person continues kneading dough until it forms cohesive ball.

3
00:00:25.596 --> 00:00:29.396
Person adds oil to dough; kneads until ball forms.

4
00:00:42.428 --> 00:00:46.596
Person divides dough; rolls portions into small balls.

5
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.731
Balls placed on baking mat beside unrolled dough portions.

6
00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:10.098
Person adds flour; kneads dough on mat.

7
00:01:15.612 --> 00:01:17.324
Rolls dough rope flat.

8
00:01:20.828 --> 00:01:23.824
Rolling dough on mat, extending length flat

9
00:01:30.076 --> 00:01:32.789
Person drizzles oil; coats dough.

10
00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:42.640
Title: "to 35 minutes".

11
00:01:45.596 --> 00:01:49.073
A person rolls dough using a wooden rolling pin on the mat.

12
00:01:52.718 --> 00:01:55.345
Person lifts and flips dough piece.
